<title>USA: ENStar says 35,903 shares tendered.</title>
<headline>ENStar says 35,903 shares tendered.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>ENStar Inc said Monday a total of 35,903 shares of its common stock were tendered in connection with its Dutch Auction tender offer.</p>
<p>The offer ended at 1600 CDT on July 25.</p>
<p>ENStar said it will purchase all of the shares at $6.25 a share.</p>
<p>ENStar is a holding company whose subsidiaries include Americable Inc and Transition Networks Inc.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
